{
  "file": "Latent",
  "page": 32,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        54.572994232177734,
        526.6273193359375,
        67.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "national guidelines and sound clinical practice. People living with HIV who present any of the four symptoms",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        68.57299041748047,
        473.7442626953125,
        81.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "but in whom active TB is excluded by investigations may be considered for preventive treatment.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        88.24297332763672,
        526.647216796875,
        101.04297637939453
      ],
      "text": "The four-symptom screening method is recommended for all people living with HIV at every visit to a health",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        102.24297332763672,
        526.6571655273438,
        115.04297637939453
      ],
      "text": "facility or contact with a health worker. As combining chest radiography with symptom screening at every",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        116.24297332763672,
        526.63525390625,
        129.04296875
      ],
      "text": "visit could represent a significant burden on the health system as well as on clients, it should be used only",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        130.24298095703125,
        526.7152709960938,
        143.04296875
      ],
      "text": "to exclude active TB before giving preventive treatment, with due respect for good clinical practice. The role",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        144.24298095703125,
        526.7172241210938,
        157.04296875
      ],
      "text": "of chest radiography in regular TB screening and its optimal frequency is uncertain. Local authorities should",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        158.24298095703125,
        526.6600952148438,
        171.04296875
      ],
      "text": "define its application and frequency on the basis of their local epidemiology, health infrastructure and resource",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.24298095703125,
        119.40912628173828,
        185.04296875
      ],
      "text": "availability.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        191.9129638671875,
        526.6561889648438,
        204.71295166015625
      ],
      "text": "It is critical to ensure proper follow-up and investigation for TB and other diseases in household contacts with",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        205.9129638671875,
        526.6761474609375,
        218.71295166015625
      ],
      "text": "abnormal chest radiographic findings or TB symptoms. The investigations should be performed in accordance",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        219.9129638671875,
        526.6638793945312,
        232.71295166015625
      ],
      "text": "with national guidelines and sound clinical practice. Contacts in whom active TB is excluded after investigations",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        233.9129638671875,
        257.7481384277344,
        246.71295166015625
      ],
      "text": "may be considered for preventive treatment.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        253.58294677734375,
        526.6502075195312,
        266.3829345703125
      ],
      "text": "Chest radiography and trained health care workers (e.g. radiologists) must be available to implement",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        267.58294677734375,
        526.7213745117188,
        280.3829345703125
      ],
      "text": "the screening rule. Where chest radiography is not available, absence of any TB symptoms alone may be",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        281.58294677734375,
        524.3922119140625,
        294.3829345703125
      ],
      "text": "considered as a criteria before preventive treatment. This would offer the highest sensitivity among symptom-",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.58294677734375,
        401.9481201171875,
        308.3829345703125
      ],
      "text": "based screening rules, and its negative predictive value is high in most settings.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        38.57630157470703,
        790.2608032226562,
        56.68830108642578,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "20",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        796.524658203125,
        458.3740539550781,
        805.5686645507812
      ],
      "text": "LATENT TUBERCULOSIS INFECTION: UPDATED AND CONSOLIDATED GUIDELINES FOR PROGRAMMATIC MANAGEMENT",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}